<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">我降生在这世间冥冥中必有原因</text><text for="L2">他日若尘归尘土归土也应是定数</text><text for="L3">四季不断更替却从未带去我心伤</text><text for="L4">所以这人生有何值得？</text><text for="L5">哪怕算是值得再一杯威士忌 又一口杜松子酒</text><text for="L6">也只不过是又饮下滴滴慢性毒药</text><text for="L7">如果我们注定步入深渊 那不如放手一搏</text><text for="L8">人生苦短 有欢须尽</text><text for="L9">Ooh-ooh-ooh,ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh</text><text for="L10">Ooh-ooh-ooh,ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh</text><text for="L11">脑中悲歌回荡 缓步踏入墓地</text><text for="L12">克劳德将军垂垂老矣 却仍觉昨日犹在</text><text for="L13">仿佛回到那日他在前线血战时被围困在海滩</text><text for="L14">残喘着爬向他的挚友 飘荡在近海</text><text for="L15">但他终究有心无力 满是遗憾</text><text for="L16">他感叹道 命运如此无常</text><text for="L17">我降生在这世间冥冥中必有原因</text><text for="L18">他日若尘归尘土归土也应是定数</text><text for="L19">四季不断更替却未曾带去我心伤</text><text for="L20">所以这人生有何值得？</text><text for="L21">哪怕算是值得再一杯威士忌 又一口杜松子酒</text><text for="L22">也只不过是又饮下滴滴慢性毒药</text><text for="L23">如果我们注定步入深渊 那不如放手一搏</text><text for="L24">人生苦短 有欢须尽</text><text for="L25">Ooh-ooh-ooh,ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh</text><text for="L26">Ooh-ooh-ooh,ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh</text><text for="L27">她心中悲歌回响 去往城里上班</text><text for="L28">三十三岁 电影明星梦早已破碎</text><text for="L29">居无定所 在吧台打着零工</text><text for="L30">起早贪黑的工作 苛省每一分钱</text><text for="L31">她可会梦想成真？她唯有唏嘘摇头</text><text for="L32">她感叹道 命运如此无常</text><text for="L33">我降生在这世间冥冥中必有原因</text><text for="L34">他日若尘归尘土归土也应是定数</text><text for="L35">四季不断更替却未曾带去我心伤</text><text for="L36">所以这人生有何值得？</text><text for="L37">哪怕算是值得再一杯威士忌 又一口杜松子酒</text><text for="L38">也只不过是又饮下滴滴慢性毒药</text><text for="L39">如果我们注定步入深渊 那不如放手一搏</text><text for="L40">人生苦短 有欢须尽</text><text for="L41">Ooh-ooh-ooh,ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh</text><text for="L42">Ooh-ooh-ooh,ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh</text><text for="L43">我降生在这世间冥冥中必有原因</text><text for="L44">他日若尘归尘土归土也应是定数</text><text for="L45">四季不断更替却不曾带去我心伤</text><text for="L46">所以这人生有何值得？</text><text for="L47">哪怕算是值得再一杯威士忌 又一口杜松子酒</text><text for="L48">也只不过是又饮下滴滴慢性毒药</text><text for="L49">如果我们注定步入深渊 那不如放手一搏</text><text for="L50">人生苦短 有欢须尽</text><text for="L51">Ooh-ooh-ooh</text><text for="L52">Ooh-ooh-ooh,ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Gotta Be a Reason"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Alec Benjamin"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Narrated For You"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="003znNpv2zELiB"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1441728853"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:11.760" end="3:24.704"><p begin="0:11.760" end="0:14.670" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:11.760" end="0:11.970">There's</span> <span begin="0:11.970" end="0:12.330">gotta</span> <span begin="0:12.330" end="0:12.660">be</span> <span begin="0:12.660" end="0:13.140">a reason</span> <span begin="0:13.140" end="0:13.380">that</span> <span begin="0:13.380" end="0:13.920">I'm here</span> <span begin="0:13.920" end="0:14.280">on</span> <span begin="0:14.280" end="0:14.670">Earth</span></p><p begin="0:14.880" end="0:17.640" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.880" end="0:15.330">Gotta</span> <span begin="0:15.330" end="0:15.630">be</span> <span begin="0:15.630" end="0:16.080">a reason</span> <span begin="0:16.080" end="0:16.320">for</span> <span begin="0:16.320" end="0:16.440">the</span> <span begin="0:16.440" end="0:16.890">dust</span> <span begin="0:16.890" end="0:17.100">and</span> <span begin="0:17.100" end="0:17.640">the dirt</span></p><p begin="0:17.790" end="0:20.580" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.790" end="0:17.940">The</span> <span begin="0:17.940" end="0:18.420">changing